# intermediate build outputs (extracted VPKs, textures, previews, unpacked trees)
build/*
# Shipped ZIPs and their checksum sidecars under the character folders that exist today.
# (Miranda_Romance, Christie, Honoka and Hila were retired 2026-11-26; the negations went with them,
# so a recreated folder of removed packs is not committed by accident.)
dist/*
!dist/Miranda_L4D2/
!dist/Geralt/
!dist/Arivus/
!dist/Miranda/
*.egg-info/
# captures and scratch
*.mkv
*.audio.raw
/scratch/
.pytest_cache/
# the parent repo ignores bin/ (build output); the CLI launcher lives here
!bin/
preview_tmp/

.hypothesis/

# pytest-cov's data file and its report
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# node_modules/ is NOT ignored: tools/pd2-las/extract_2b.py deliberately tracks node-unrar-js
